WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.504 --> 00:00:06.267
Yikes! [s@Yikes!

2
00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:16.473
Who are you?

3
00:00:18.955 --> 00:00:20.436
I'm a hammerhead shark.

4
00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:23.978
Hammerhead sharks are big fish.

5
00:00:25.799 --> 00:00:26.900
Where do you live?

6
00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:30.937
Hammerhead sharks live in the ocean.

7
00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:34.718
We swim in deep water.

8
00:00:37.359 --> 00:00:39.900
And sometimes we swim close to land.

9
00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.841
Your head looks cool!

10
00:00:45.241 --> 00:00:47.062
Our eyes are wide apart.

11
00:00:48.742 --> 00:00:50.183
They help us see well.

12
00:00:51.883 --> 00:00:53.884
We're good at finding stingrays!

13
00:00:56.492 --> 00:00:58.674
Are stingrays your favorite food?

14
00:01:00.556 --> 00:01:04.039
Yes. But we eat other ocean animals, too.

15
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.382
We like fish, crabs, and squid.

16
00:01:09.905 --> 00:01:11.446
Do sharks lay eggs?

17
00:01:12.887 --> 00:01:14.269
Some sharks lay eggs.

18
00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:18.092
But hammerhead eggs hatch inside the mother.

19
00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:21.896
Babies are born about one year later.

20
00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.221
You have sharp teeth!

21
00:01:29.821 --> 00:01:31.362
We have lots of teeth.

22
00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:35.823
We use them for eating prey.

23
00:01:39.544 --> 00:01:41.165
Do you have any enemies?

24
00:01:42.525 --> 00:01:43.665
Animals don't hunt us.

25
00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:47.507
But some people hunt us for our fins.

26
00:01:49.307 --> 00:01:51.848
And sometimes we get caught in fishing nets.

27
00:01:57.464 --> 00:01:58.367
There's a stingray.

28
00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:00.794
It's time to hunt!

29
00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:04.746
Good-bye, Hammerhead Shark!
